# Allowlist: the image gets the package, its lock and the agent definition —
# nothing else in this directory, and never a credential. pi's own config is
# generated at container start, so it is not a build input.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!.pi/agents/
!image/

# Re-excluded after the allowlist (last match wins). Running the gate leaves a
# __pycache__ beside the package; it must not reach the image.
**/__pycache__
.env
secrets/
**/*.pem
